{"sha": "56a2b4b774569fd3346438ef3b6ea51842f22f3fd7fa6af971bbbe41d4023568", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:fluid-kinematics} 章 --- 流体运动学}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:1}", "(a) $\\ell/L \\sim 7 \\times 10^{-8}$：连续介质。(b) $0.07$：临界 ---", "连续介质定律开始失效（壁面滑移）。(c) $\\ell = 70 \\times 10^{-9}", "/3 \\times 10^{-7} = \\qty{0.23}{m}$，$\\ell/L = 0.23$：不是连续介质；气体", "是由独立分子组成的“分子雨”（自由分子区）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:2}", "$a = v\\,\\dd v/\\dd x = v_0^2(1 + x/L)/L$（从 $v_0^2/L$ 增至 $2v_0^2/L$）。", "$\\dd x/\\dd t = v_0(1 + x/L)$：$t = (L/v_0)\\ln2 = 0.69\\,L/v_0$，介于", "$L/2v_0$ 与 $L/v_0$ 之间。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:3}", "$D_V = \\int_0^Rv_{\\max}(1 - r^2/R^2)\\,2\\pi r\\,\\dd r = \\tfrac12\\pi R^2v_{\\max}$；", "$\\langle v\\rangle = v_{\\max}/2 = \\qty{0.20}{m/s}$；$D_V = \\qty{1.6e-5}{m^3/s} =", "\\qty{16}{mL/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:4}", "(a) $\\operatorname{div} = 0$，$\\vect\\omega = \\vect 0$：不可压缩、", "无旋。(b) $\\operatorname{div} = 0$，$\\omega_z = 2\\Omega$：刚体", "转动。(c) $\\operatorname{div} = 2a \\ne 0$，无旋（平面", "源）。(d) $\\operatorname{div} = 0$，$\\omega_z = -k$：剪切流。(e)", "$\\operatorname{div} = b$：仅当 $b = 0$ 时不可压缩；对", "每个 $b$ 都无旋。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:5}", "$D_V = \\qty{0.20}{L/s}$。软管 $S = \\qty{1.13}{cm^2}$：$v = \\qty{1.8}{m/s}$；喷管", "$S = \\qty{7.1}{mm^2}$：$v = \\qty{28}{m/s}$。平均加速度 $\\Delta(v^2/2)/L", "= (28^2 - 1.8^2)/0.08 \\approx \\qty{1e4}{m/s^2} \\approx 1000\\,g$。时间 $\\approx", "\\int\\dd x/v$：约几毫秒（线性速度分布时为 \\qty{4}{ms}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:6}", "(a) $\\dd y/\\dd x = (V/U)\\cos\\omega t$：斜率为", "$(V/U)\\cos\\omega t$ 的直线，彼此平行，且随时间倾斜。(b) $x = Ut$，$y =", "(V/\\omega)\\sin\\omega t$：正弦曲线 $y = (V/\\omega)\\sin(\\omega x/U)$。(c) 在", "$t = 0$ 时，流线与横轴成 \\qty{45}{\\degree}，迹线", "从原点出发时与横轴成 \\qty{45}{\\degree}；在 $t = \\pi/2\\omega$ 时流线", "水平，而迹线为固定的正弦曲线。两者不同，是因为", "流动非定常：流线是某一时刻的快照，迹线则是质点的历史。", "(d) $\\vect a = \\partial_t\\vect v = (0, -V\\omega\\sin\\omega t)$ --- 该场是", "均匀的，因此对流项为零。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:7}", "(a) $D_V = 50 \\times 2 \\times 1.2 = \\qty{120}{m^3/s}$。(b) $120/60 = \\qty{2.0}{m/s}$。", "(c) $150/150 = \\qty{1.0}{m/s}$。(d) 若 $\\rho \\propto 1/T$，且压强 $P$ 不变，则", "密度减半；$\\rho vS$ 守恒，速率加倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:8}", "(a) $\\omega_z = \\frac1r\\frac{\\dd(rv_\\theta)}{\\dd r}$：内部为 $2\\Omega$，外部", "为 $0$。(b) 内部 $\\Gamma = 2\\pi r\\cdot\\Omega r = 2\\Omega\\cdot\\pi r^2$，即", "涡量的通量；外部 $\\Gamma = 2\\pi\\Omega a^2$，为常数，即", "整个涡核的通量。(c) $\\Omega = v_{\\max}/a = \\qty{1.4}{rad/s}$；$\\Gamma = 2\\pi av_{\\max}", "= \\qty{2.2e4}{m^2/s}$；在 \\qty{500}{m} 处：$\\Omega a^2/r = \\qty{7}{m/s}$。(d) 涡核", "像刚体一样转动；外部流动无旋：质点", "绕轴运动，自身却不发生自转。涡量 ---", "即旋转 --- 只存在于涡核中。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:9}", "(a) $\\varphi = \\tfrac12k(x^2 - y^2)$，$\\Delta\\varphi = k - k = 0$。(b) $\\dd x/", "kx = \\dd y/(-ky)$：$xy = $ 常数；$\\partial_y\\psi = kx = v_x$，$-\\partial_x\\psi =", "-ky = v_y$。(c) $\\vect a = (v_x\\partial_x + v_y\\partial_y)\\vect v = k^2(x, y) =", "\\operatorname{\\vect{grad}}\\bigl(\\tfrac12k^2(x^2 + y^2)\\bigr) = \\operatorname{\\vect{grad}}", "(v^2/2)$：在定常无旋流动中，加速度是", "单位质量动能的梯度；它指向远离", "驻点的方向 --- 质点沿 $y$ 方向接近壁面时减速，", "沿 $x$ 方向远离时加速。(d) $\\dot x = kx$，$\\dot y = -ky$：", "$x = x_0\\eu^{kt}$，$y = y_0\\eu^{-kt}$（$xy$ 为常数）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:10}", "(a) $\\dd x/\\dd t = x/(t + \\tau)$ 给出 $x = x_0(1 + t/\\tau)$，$\\ddot x = 0$；", "随体导数：$\\partial_tv + v\\partial_xv = -x/(t + \\tau)^2 + x/(t + \\tau)^2", "= 0$。(b) $\\partial_t\\rho + \\partial_x(\\rho v) = \\dot\\rho + \\rho/(t + \\tau) = 0$：$\\rho =", "\\rho_0\\tau/(t + \\tau)$。(c) 两质点间距按 $(1 + t/\\tau)$ 增长，", "而它们之间的质量固定：$\\rho \\propto 1/(1 + t/\\tau)$。(d) $v =", "Hx$，$H = 1/(t + \\tau)$：哈勃定律，自由膨胀（无", "加速度），密度与尺度因子成反比下降。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:11}", "(a) $\\vect v = \\operatorname{\\vect{grad}}\\varphi = (U + qx/2\\pi r^2, qy/2\\pi r^2)$；", "源的 $v_r = q/2\\pi r$，$\\operatorname{div} = \\frac1r\\dd(rv_r)/\\dd r", "= 0$，且与 $\\theta$ 无关，因此 $\\omega_z = 0$；这类场的叠加", "仍是不可压缩、无旋的。(b) 在负 $x$ 轴上，", "$U - q/2\\pi r = 0$：$x_s = -q/2\\pi U$。(c) 在驻点 $\\theta =", "\\pi$，$y = 0$ 处：$\\psi = q/2$；流线 $Ur\\sin\\theta + q\\theta/2\\pi = q/2$，", "即 $r\\sin\\theta = (q/2\\pi U)(\\pi - \\theta)$ --- 一条从 $x_s$ 出发、", "向下游张开的曲线。(d) $\\theta \\to 0$：$y \\to q/2U$；$\\theta \\to 2\\pi$（下", "支）：$y \\to -q/2U$。该流线内侧的流体来自", "源；其外侧则是均匀来流绕过一个", "渐近宽度为 $q/U$ 的半体。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fluid-kinematics:12}", "(a) $\\operatorname{div}\\vect v = \\frac1r\\partial_r(-q/2\\pi) = 0$；$\\omega_z =", "\\frac1r\\partial_r(\\Gamma/2\\pi) = 0$。(b) 由 $\\dd r/v_r = r\\,\\dd\\theta/v_\\theta$ 可得", "$\\dd r/r = -(q/\\Gamma)\\dd\\theta$。(c) $a_r = v_r\\partial_rv_r - v_\\theta^2/r =", "-(q^2 + \\Gamma^2)/4\\pi^2r^3 = -v^2/r$；$a_\\theta = v_r\\partial_rv_\\theta + v_rv_\\theta/r", "= 0$。(d) $\\dd r/\\dd t = -q/2\\pi r$：$t = \\pi(r_0^2 - a^2)/q$；圈数", "$= (\\Gamma/2\\pi q)\\ln(r_0/a)$。(e) $t = \\qty{520}{s} \\approx \\qty{9}{min}$；$10$", "圈。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}